====================================================================
OVERALL STATUS
====================================================================

Main calculation defects identified and corrected.

The corrected program now:
- Calculates subtotal using price * quantity.
- Applies a 10% discount when subtotal is greater than 100.
- Applies £5 shipping when the amount after discount is below 50.
- Rejects quantities of 0 or below.
- Rejects prices of 0 or below.
- Returns the final order total for valid orders.